      "params_digest": "59edd8ed14360e80",
      "query": "{\"content\": \"P(grant) 0.85. The petition challenges the constitutionality of a federal statute (26 U.S.C. \\u00a7 5601(a)(6), the home distilling ban) under the Commerce Clause, explicitly asking the Court to reconsider or limit *Gonzales v. Raich*. There is a clear and direct circuit split: the Sixth Circuit upheld the statute in this case on April 21, 2026, breaking with the Fifth Circuit's decision in *McNutt v. US Dept of Justice* on April 10, 2026, which struck the statute down. \\n\\nThe sali",
